Actually, looking at the AscendC documentation, TQue is a circular buffer. When you AllocTensor, it gives you a buffer from the pool. When you FreeTensor, it returns the buffer to the pool. If you don't FreeTensor, the buffer is still associated with the queue and will be reused.

